OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen tree fall misses
OL,4,Amotorists by seconds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver has spoken of how he and other
OL,7,Fmotorists had a lucky escape when a
OL,8,Ftree plummeted down on to a car on
OL,9,FFriday afternoon during Storm Austen.
OL,11,FBarry Boustead was driving down
OL,12,FThornhill Road in Streetly when part of
OL,13,Fa tree crashed down onto the car in
OL,14,Ffront of him.
OL,16,FHe told BBC Radio WM: "If it was one
OL,17,Fsecond later, [the driver] would have
OL,18,Fhad the main trunk come down in the
OL,19,Fmiddle of the car. It was quite scary.
OL,20,FIf I was two seconds further forward,
OL,21,Fit would have been straight down the
OL,22,Fmiddle of [my] van, I'm sure."
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
